707
00:26:40,930 --> 00:26:43,630
I mean checking this data in the lower 12 bits

708
00:26:43,630 --> 00:26:44,810
to see if it has certain characteristics

709
00:26:44,810 --> 00:26:46,950
In some cases it's really simple

