00:27:11,270 --> 00:27:14,330
LI is actually short for load immediate

721
00:27:14,330 --> 00:27:16,070
That's the idea of loading an immediate.

722
00:27:16,070 --> 00:27:17,530
It's basically taking an immediate value

723
00:27:17,530 --> 00:27:20,210
In effect, it's like directly loading a value into a register.

724
00:27:20,210 --> 00:27:24,110
So if you write it using this kind of micro-instruction,

